<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51281" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vŏlātĭlis</span></b> ,
		e, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>flying</i>, <i>winged</i> (class.; cf. ales).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bestiae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D. 2, 60, 151</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puer,</span>”
				i. e. <i>Cupid</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Am. 2, 7, 27</span></i>
			.—<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vŏlātĭlĕ</span></b> ,
				is, n., <i>a fowl</i>
			(late Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnia volatilia caeli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. Ezek. 32, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omne volatile,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Gen. 1, 21</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Swift</i>, <i>rapid</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">telum,</span>”
				i. e. <i>an arrow</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					1, 970</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov. A. A. 1, 169</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. M. 7,
				841</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ferrum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 4, 71</span></i>
			: cervus, Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. p. 559,
			23</span></i>, and 515, 20 (al. volabile).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Fleeting</i>, <i>transitory</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aetas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 10, 519</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gloria vanum et volatile quiddam est
					aurāque mobilius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 123, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lepra,</span>”
				<i>changing from one part to another</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Lev. 13, 57</span></i>
			.</div>
